Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["LicDongleRotateWriteKey", "ObjectName", 
      CellID -> 1321524927], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleRotateWriteKey", "[", 
            RowBox[{StyleBox["handle", "TI"], ",", StyleBox["key", "TI"]}], 
            "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], 
        " \[LineSeparator]replaces the dongle's write key with key."}], 
      "Usage", CellID -> 2077221701], Cell["key is a P-256 private key in \
PKCS#8 DER form, as a ByteArray. From the next session onward only this key \
elevates the session.", "Notes", CellID -> 958487682], 
     Cell["A dongle rotated to a key that is lost has to be re-provisioned; \
keep the key as you keep your license-signing key.", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 539495878], 
     Cell["LicDongleInfo[handle][\"WriteAuthRotated\"] is True afterwards.", 
      "Notes", CellID -> 1462713684], Cell["The call needs the write role; \
elevate the session with LicDongleAuthorizeWrite.", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 1229695219], Cell["On failure the result is \
Failure[\"LicDongleError\", ...] with \"Status\" (the C status code), \
\"Operation\" and \"Detail\".", "Notes", CellID -> 1045207145]}, Open]], 
